# What kac writes into this corpus and rebuilds whole each run. The editor and
# operating-system noise common to every folder is in the repository's own .gitignore,
# which this one adds to.

# Generated — rebuilt by `kac generate`
_reports/

# Generated — `export` rebuilds .dist/export/ whole, `bundle` rebuilds .dist/plugin/ and the
# marketplace beside it, and `pack` rebuilds .dist/package/. One rule covers all three.
.dist/
